\title{Notation for node ranks}
\date{2026-11-25T22:29:19Z}
\tag{algorithms}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{We want to talk about the rank of nodes before and after applying the splay rules. In general, for a node #{x} we will use #{R(x)} to refer to the rank of #{x} \em{before} applying a rule, and #{R'(x)} to refer to its new rank \em{after} applying the rule.}
